<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title><%= title %></title>

<style>
*{
    margin:0;
    padding:0;
    box-sizing:border-box;
}

body{
    background:#f5f5f5;
    font-family:Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    color:#333;
    line-height:1.7;
}

.container{
    max-width:700px;
    margin:40px auto;
    background:#ffffff;
    border-radius:10px;
    overflow:hidden;
}

.content{
    padding:40px;
}

.small-text{
    color:#777;
    font-size:13px;
}

.title{
    font-size:34px;
    font-weight:bold;
    color:#222;
    line-height:1.25;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.author{
    margin-bottom:25px;
    color:#666;
    font-size:14px;
}

.cover{
    width:100%;
    border-radius:8px;
}

.credit{
    text-align:center;
    font-size:12px;
    color:#888;
    margin-top:8px;
    margin-bottom:30px;
}

.excerpt{
    font-size:18px;
    color:#555;
    margin-bottom:25px;
}

.body{
    font-size:16px;
    color:#444;
}

.button-wrapper{
    margin:40px 0;
}

.button{
    display:inline-block;
    background:#198754;
    color:white !important;
    text-decoration:none;
    padding:14px 28px;
    border-radius:50px;
    font-weight:bold;
}

hr{
    border:none;
    border-top:1px solid #eee;
    margin:40px 0;
}

.footer{
    padding:30px 40px;
    background:#fafafa;
    text-align:center;
    font-size:14px;
    color:#777;
}

.footer a{
    color:#198754;
    text-decoration:none;
}

.unsubscribe{
    display:inline-block;
    margin-top:20px;
    padding:12px 22px;
    background:#ffffff;
    border:1px solid #ddd;
    border-radius:50px;
    color:#666 !important;
    text-decoration:none;
}

.social{
    margin-top:25px;
}

.social a{
    margin:0 10px;
    color:#198754;
    text-decoration:none;
}

@media(max-width:600px){

.content{
    padding:25px;
}

.footer{
    padding:25px;
}

.title{
    font-size:28px;
}

.excerpt{
    font-size:16px;
}

}
</style>

</head>

<body>

<div class="container">

<div class="content">

<p class="small-text">
📬 New Article Published
</p>

<h1 class="title">
<%= title %>
</h1>

<div class="author">
Published by <strong>Adesnotes</strong> •
<%= createdAt %>
</div>

<img
class="cover"
src="<%= coverImage %>"
alt="<%= title %>"
>

<% if(coverImageCredit){ %>
<div class="credit">
<%= coverImageCredit %>
</div>
<% } %>

<p class="excerpt">
<%= excerpt %>
</p>

<div class="body">

<p>
A new article has just been published on our blog and we thought you would love to read it.
</p>

<br>

<p>
<%= content.slice(0, 100) %>
</p>

</div>

<div class="button-wrapper">

<a
class="button"
href="<%= `https://adesnotes.tech/blogs/${slug}` %>">
Continue Reading →
</a>

</div>

<hr>

<p style="font-size:14px;color:#777;">
You're receiving this email because you subscribed to receive updates whenever we publish new articles on Adesnotes.
</p>

</div>

<div class="footer">

<p>
<strong>Thank you for being part of our community ❤️</strong>
</p>

<br>

<p>
We hope every article helps you become better at your life endevours.
</p>



<a
class="unsubscribe"
href="https://adesnotes.tech/unsubcribe">
Unsubscribe
</a>

<p style="margin-top:25px;font-size:12px;color:#999;">
© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Adesnotes.<br>
If you no longer wish to receive newsletters from us, simply click the unsubscribe button above.
</p>

</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>